%% title: Who sees the answers to a survey
%% desc: You send one answer for each teacher and subject. The school does not see the result until the survey is closed and at least the minimum number of answers has come in. The teacher the survey is about does not see their own result this way.
flowchart LR
  Y["Your answer<br/>once per teacher and subject"] --> C{"Survey closed?<br/>At least the minimum answers?<br/>(usually 5)"}
  C -- "No" --> X["Result hidden<br/>only the answer count"]
  C -- "Yes" --> M["School sees the average stars<br/>and written comments, without names"]:::done
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
